# What this engine says, case by case, for ruru.
#
# Russian is not IBM's and there is nothing to hold it
# to: these are what this engine does, not what any
# original did. They are here so that a change to
# Russian can be told from an accident, which is the
# only check Russian will ever have besides an ear.
#
# The wide cases are the wideband voice, which IBM never
# made: an ear blessed them, not an original.
#
# Written by test/matrix.sh record. One line a case:
# the category, which case in it, the first sixteen hex of
# the samples' hash, the same of the reported answers', and
# the sentence.

